        📚 Topics Covered

    </h4>


    <ul class="list-group mb-4">

        <li class="list-group-item">
            Tables
        </li>

        <li class="list-group-item">
            Bar Graphs
        </li>

        <li class="list-group-item">
            Pie Charts
        </li>

        <li class="list-group-item">
            Line Graphs
        </li>

        <li class="list-group-item">
            Mixed Graphs
        </li>

        <li class="list-group-item">
            Caselets
        </li>

        <li class="list-group-item">
            Data Comparison
        </li>

        <li class="list-group-item">
            Percentage Calculations
        </li>

        <li class="list-group-item">
            Ratio and Average
