            A company's sales are 120, 150, 180, and
            200 units in four months.

            What is the average sales?

        </div>


        <label class="option">

            <input
                type="radio"
                name="q1"
                value="150">

            150 units

        </label>


        <label class="option">

            <input
                type="radio"
                name="q1"
                value="162.5">

            162.5 units

        </label>


        <label class="option">

            <input
                type="radio"
                name="q1"
                value="175">

            175 units

        </label>


        <label class="option">

            <input
                type="radio"
                name="q1"
                value="180">

            180 units

        </label>


        <button
            class="submit-question"
            onclick="checkAnswer(1, '162.5')">

            Submit Answer

        </button>


        <div id="result1"
             class="answer-result">

        </div>

